# JavaScript.

language javascript
files *.js *.mjs *.cjs *.jsx
shebang node deno bun

word-chars $
comment //
comment /* */
string "
string '
string ` multiline

keywords async await break case catch class const continue debugger default
keywords delete do else export extends finally for from function get if
keywords import in instanceof let new of return set static super switch
keywords this throw try typeof var void while with yield

constants true false null undefined NaN Infinity globalThis

types Array ArrayBuffer BigInt Boolean DataView Date Error Function Intl
types JSON Map Math Number Object Promise Proxy Reflect RegExp Set String
types Symbol WeakMap WeakRef WeakSet

declares function function
declares type class
